  "details": "If you have invites and requests more than 4, you cannot \"skip\" the earlier ones to deal with the later ones once the 4 stack fills up.  Example case:  in the dev meetup, many people were trying to join a world.  I got 5-6 invite requests before I was in the world, which I wanted to keep so I could invite the people once I joined.  But I could not accept my own incoming invitation without dismissing enough requests first.",
